    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "After more than two years of proceedings under competition law, regulators have rejected inadequate remedy proposals and are finalizing a major financial sanction. This action against the search engine provider aims to correct the harm done to smaller businesses squeezed out by self-preferencing in search results, securing substantial recompense before the Commission's August recess.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-1",
          "result-0"
        ],
