        "salience_rank": 0
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The parent entity bearing cumulative accountability now faces another antitrust fine, adding to a pattern of regulatory action. This penalty is a response to a gatekeeper company exploiting its position, aiming to deliver justice for those disadvantaged by its practices in the digital markets framework.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-0",
          "result-1"
        ],
        "center": "result-1",
