        "composition_mode": "ADR-0008",
        "salience_rank": 1
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.8
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The technology company with a duty of care saw its remedy proposals dismissed as insufficient. Protecting market fairness, European authorities are now imposing a monetary sanction to address the company's self-preferencing, a decision expected to provide recompense for the harm caused to rival comparison platforms.",
